ccextractor (0.96-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release.
  * Major changes since 0.88:
    - Added Rust components (lib_ccxr) for improved safety and performance
    - CEA-708 decoder rewritten in Rust
    - Added HEVC/H.265 caption extraction support
    - Added Korean EUC-KR encoding support in CEA-708
    - Added DVB teletext stream detection in WTV files
    - Added MCC output format support
    - Added --list-tracks option to list media file tracks
    - Improved DVB subtitle OCR quality
    - Many bug fixes and memory safety improvements
  * Updated build system to support Rust components
  * Updated Standards-Version to 4.6.2
  * Updated debhelper compatibility to 13

 -- Carlos Fernandez Sanz <carlos@ccextractor.org>  Sat, 21 Dec 2025 12:00:00 +0000
